<title>BELGIUM: UCO TEXTILES 1996 PROFIT 428 MLN BFR.</title>
<headline>UCO TEXTILES 1996 PROFIT 428 MLN BFR.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31,</p>
<p>1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit	 428 mln   vs   n/a *</p>
<p>    Current profit	   263 mln   vs   n/a *</p>
<p>    Exceptional gain	 179 mln   vs   n/a *</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)  150	 vs   n/a *</p>
<p>NOTE - During 1996 Belgian textiles company UCO NV</p>
<p>split into two separately traded units UCO Textiles NV and</p>
<p>Belvuco NV therefore results are not directly comparable with</p>
<p>previous years.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
